{"t_ms": 348546, "conversation_id": "v2llm_streaming_retrieve_s012", "turn_id": 1, "actor": "system", "event_type": "retrieval_result", "payload": {"passages": ["Food Allergy Information\n\nGrand Horizon Hotel & Suites\n\nGuests with food allergies or dietary restrictions are encouraged to inform the restaurant staff before placing an order. Menu items may contain allergens such as nuts, dairy, gluten, eggs, or seafood. The culinary team will make every reasonable effort to accommodate special dietary requirements while maintaining food safety standards.", "Kids Menu\n\nGrand Horizon Hotel & Suites\n\nA dedicated children's menu is available at the Horizon Restaurant and through room service. Popular options include mini pizzas, pasta, sandwiches, fruit bowls, fresh juices, and healthy snacks. Parents may request customized meals for children with dietary restrictions or allergies by informing the restaurant staff in advance.", "Breakfast Timings\n\nGrand Horizon Hotel & Suites\n\nThe breakfast buffet is available daily from 6:30 AM to 10:00 AM at the Horizon Restaurant. Guests are encouraged to arrive early during weekends to avoid waiting times. Breakfast service concludes promptly at 10:00 AM, after which the restaurant begins lunch preparations."], "scores": [0.5115677714347839, 0.8178451061248779, 0.8928027153015137], "filenames": ["28_food_allergy.txt", "27_kids_menu.txt", "58_breakfast_v2.txt"], "timing_policy": "sentence_end", "timing_trigger": "sentence_end", "user_end_known_at_finish": true, "launch_offset_ms_vs_user_end": 360, "overlap_with_speech_ms": 0, "forecast_invalidated": false}}
